# Smoke test of the runner (not a spec): pinyin typed after some text shows in the panel's input line
# (contract v1.3: never marked in the field), Space puts the first candidate in.
NAME     pinyin shows in the panel, then Space puts the first candidate in after the text
PROFILES all
LANG     chinese
TEXT     "Hi Bob|"
TYPE     nihao
EXPECT   marked none
EXPECT   preedit "ni hao"
EXPECT   panel shown
KEY      space
EXPECT   doc "Hi Bob你好|"
EXPECT   marked none
EXPECT   preedit none
EXPECT   panel hidden
EXPECT   lang chinese
EXPECT   nolost
